0008:     """
0009:     Swap the upper two-pixel segment and the lower two-pixel segment around the fixed center pixel.
0010: 
0011:     Input structure:
0012:     - The grid is a 5x1 vertical column of individual colored pixels.
0013:     - The middle pixel is a separator between two same-size two-pixel segments.
0014: 
0015:     Rule:
